	A Salt Labs working playbook. Practical guidance, not professional advice — always follow your organization's policies.
	<span>·</span> <a href="/updates/changelog/">Changelog</a>
	<span>·</span> <a href="/maintaining/how-to-contribute/">Suggest a change</a>
</p>

<style>
	.pb-disclaimer {
		margin-top: 2.5rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
		font-size: var(--sl-text-xs); color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); text-align: center;
	}
	.pb-disclaimer a { color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
	.pb-disclaimer span { margin: 0 0.35rem; opacity: 0.6; }
</style>
